Package: filterfdr
Type: Package
Title: Filtering, FDR Bias and Power in Two-Group Testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("fossil contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Rebuilds the methods of van Iterson, Boer and Menezes (2010)
    <doi:10.1186/1471-2105-11-450>: the bitriangular two-group simulation,
    signal, fold-change and variance filters, achieved FDR and power under
    BH, BY, adaptive BH and q-value correction after filtering, the
    permutation test for filtering-induced FDR bias, and the p-value
    densities of the Student t test after filtering.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    multtest (>= 2.58),
    qvalue (>= 2.34)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    markdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
biocViews: MultipleComparison, DifferentialExpression, Microarray
Config/testthat/edition: 3
